          },
          {
            "description": "While the broccoli cooks, heat 2 tbsp butter and the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat. Add the garlic and sauté for about 2 minutes, stirring frequently. Do not let the garlic brown, as it can become bitter.",
            "image": ""
          },
          {
            "description": "Remove the broccoli from the water with a slotted spoon and add it to the skillet. Increase the heat slightly and cook until the broccoli becomes very soft. Mash or crush the broccoli with a spoon or masher as it cooks. Add red pepper flakes if desired.",
