          {
            "description": "Drain the pasta and add it to the skillet with the broccoli. Stir thoroughly to combine.",
            "image": ""
          },
          {
            "description": "Add the remaining 2 tbsp butter and about ¾ cup Parmesan cheese. Stir until everything is well incorporated. If the mixture is too dry, add reserved pasta water a little at a time until you reach your desired consistency.",
            "image": ""
          },
          {
            "description": "Taste and adjust with salt, black pepper, additional Parmesan, or red pepper flakes as desired. Serve immediately.",
